ight="1000" loading="eager"><span class="food-stamp">EAT<br>LOCAL</span></div></header><div class="filters"><label>Search shop names<input id="shop-search" type="search" placeholder="Type the shop name you want"></label><label>Category<select id="shop-category"><option value="all">All Shops</option><option value="restaurant">Restaurants</option><option value="drink_shop">Drinks</option><option value="souvenir_shop">Souvenirs</option></select></label><button class="button button-outline" id="clear-shops" type="button">Clear filters</button></div><p id="results" role="status" aria-live="polite">Show 108 shops</p><p id="empty" hidden>No list found. Try a different search term or select another category.</p><section class="shop-group" data-category="restaurant"><h2>Restaurants <span class="count">48</span></h2><ol class="shop-list"><li id="khanom-jeen-pa-mom" data-shop="ขนมจีนป้าม่อม Khanom Jeen Pa Mom ร้านขนมจีนตำนานคู่ตะกั่วป่า มีน้ำยาให้เลือกถึง 8 ชนิดพร้อมผักเหนาะจัดเต็ม" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Khanom Jeen Pa Mom · Khanom Jeen Pa Mom<small class="shop-note">A long-standing Khanom Jeen (rice noodles) shop in Takua Pa, offering 8 types of curries and a full set of fresh side vegetables.</small><small class="shop-meta">Tambon Takua Pa</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.wongnai.com/restaurants/404169qD" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="khanom-jeen-phi-neng" data-shop="ขนมจีนพี่เหน่ง Khanom Jeen Phi Neng ขนมจีนรสเด็ดในตลาดลานโล่ง เติมผักสดผักดองได้ไม่อั้น ราคาประหยัด" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Khanom Jeen Phi Neng · Khanom Jeen Phi Neng<small class="shop-note">Flavorful Khanom Jeen (rice noodles) in the Lan Long market with unlimited fresh and pickled vegetables at affordable prices.</small><small class="shop-meta">11:00-20:00 · Takua Pa Subdistrict</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.wongnai.com/restaurants/khanomjeen-phi-neng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="khanom-jeen-nai-na" data-shop="ขนมจีนในนา Khanom Jeen Nai Na ร้านขนมจีนบรรยากาศร่มรื่นกลางสวนปาล์ม ขายแบบเป็นชุดพร้อมน้ำยาหลากหลาย" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Khanom Jeen Nai Na · Khanom Jeen Nai Na<small class="shop-note">Khanom Jeen (rice noodles) shop in a shady palm garden setting, served as a set with various curries.</small><small class="shop-meta">Friday · Sunday 08:00-17:00 · Bang Nai Si Subdistrict</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://roijang.com/phangnga/kanom-jeen-nai-na/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="karkinos-khao-lak" data-shop="คาคีนอส เขาหลัก KARKINOS KHAO LAK บีชคลับและร้านอาหารอิตาเลียนริมหาดปะการัง บรรยากาศโอเพ่นแอร์เหมาะแก่การชมพระอาทิตย์ตก" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/karkinoskhaolak/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KARKINOS KHAO LAK · KARKINOS KHAO LAK</a><small class="shop-note">Beach club and Italian restaurant at Pakarang beach with an open-air atmosphere suitable for watching the sunset.</small><small class="shop-meta">11:00 - 22:00 (daily) · Khuekkhak Subdistrict</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%AA%20%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/karkinoskhaolak/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="tubtim-dimsum" data-shop="ทับทิม ติ่มซำ Tubtim Dimsum ร้านอาหารเช้าและติ่มซำบรรยากาศดี ท่ามกลางสวนดอกไม้และต้นไม้ร่มรื่น" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Tubtim Dimsum · Tubtim Dimsum<small class="shop-note">Breakfast and dim sum shop with a good atmosphere, surrounded by a flower garden and shady trees.</small><small class="shop-meta">Morning</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%A1%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B3%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.wongnai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="kai-tong-dimsum" data-shop="ไก่โต้ง อาหารเช้า Kai Tong Dimsum ร้านติ่มซำนึ่งสดและอาหารเช้ายอดนิยมของคนท้องถิ่นและนักท่องเที่ยว" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Kai Tong Breakfast · Kai Tong Dimsum<small class="shop-note">Freshly steamed dim sum and breakfast shop frequented by locals and tourists.</small><small class="shop-meta">07:00 - 11:00 · Bang Nai Si</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%20%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8A%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.ryoiireview.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="punthong-dimsum" data-shop="ปั้นทองติ่มซำ Punthong Dimsum ร้านติ่มซำนึ่งสดกว่า 60 เมนู เลือกจากตู้ให้พนักงานนึ่งร้อนๆ บริการรวดเร็ว" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Punthong Dimsum · Punthong Dimsum<small class="shop-note">Dim sum shop offering over 60 freshly steamed menus where customers can choose from the cabinet for quick, hot service.</small><small class="shop-meta">06:30 - 11:30 · Khuek Khak</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B3%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.wongnai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="hua-ta-bistro" data-shop="หัวท่า บิสโทร Hua Ta Bistro ร้านอาหารฟิวชั่นในบ้านเก่า ตกแต่งสไตล์วินเทจย้อนยุคเมืองตะกั่วป่า" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Hua Ta Bistro · Hua Ta Bistro<small class="shop-note">Fusion restaurant in an old house, decorated in a vintage Takua Pa retr