ตึ๋ง" aria-pressed="false">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า" aria-pressed="false">Pun Thao Kong A Shrine</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง" aria-pressed="false">Guan Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" aria-pressed="false">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="สวนสาธารณะทุ่งพระโพธิ์" aria-pressed="false">Thung Phra Pho Park</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์" aria-pressed="false">Phra Narai Park</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง" aria-pressed="false">Boon Soong Iron Bridge</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง" aria-pressed="false">Tao Ming School</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2026" aria-pressed="false">2026 (B.E. 2569)</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2025" aria-pressed="false">2025 (B.E. 2568)</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2024" aria-pressed="false">2024 (B.E. 2567)</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2023" aria-pressed="false">2023 (B.E. 2566)</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2022" aria-pressed="false">2022 (B.E. 2565)</button><button type="button" data-news-filter="2021" aria-pressed="false">2021 (B.E. 2564)</button></div><div class="news-list-full"><article class="news-item" data-place="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-05-04">4 May 2026 (B.E. 2569)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Praying for blessings at Kue Chai Tung Shrine, Phang Nga Province</h2><p>NBT news recommended the shrine and its role as a centre of faith for Takua Pa people.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a> · NBT2HD</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q6K2Zl6700I" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ตักบาตรยามรุ่ง รับอรุณปีใหม่" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-04-13">13 Apr 2026 (2569 BE)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga Hosts Grand Songkran, Alms Giving in Takua Pa Old Town for Thai New Year Blessings</h2><p>News reported a dry food alms giving ceremony on the cultural street of Takua Pa Old Town, along with ongoing cultural activities.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">New Year's Dawn Almsgiving</a> · TOPNEWS</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.topnews.co.th/news/1546452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ตักบาตรยามรุ่ง รับอรุณปีใหม่" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-04-13">13 Apr 2026 (2569 BE)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Takua Pa Blooms! Retracing Old Town Charm at Takuapa Oldtown Songkran Festival 2026</h2><p>News described the 4th Old Town Songkran event and morning alms giving activities.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">New Year's Dawn Almsgiving</a> · MGR Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/onlinesection/detail/9690000036775" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="สวนสาธารณะทุ่งพระโพธิ์" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-03-08">8 March 2026 (B.E. 2569)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Takua Pa Khiri Khet School participates in Takua Pa Walk Rally 2026 (2569 BE)</h2><p>The event uses Thung Phra Pho Public Park and the old town area as a walking and running route to learn about local history and culture.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/thung-phra/">Thung Phra Pho Park</a> · Takua Pa Khiri Khet School</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.keereekatschool.ac.th/gallery-detail_1497" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-03-01">1 March 2026 (B.E. 2569)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga hosts the 12th 'From Takola to Takua Pa' event</h2><p>The event promotes Takua Pa old town tourism, linking to local lifestyle learning and community economy, but the news does not directly confirm activities inside the museum.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/museum/">Takua Pa Community Museum</a> · สถานีวิทยุกระจายเสียงแห่งประเทศไทย (Radio Thailand)</div><span class="news-out news-out-offline">Original article has been taken down · checked 8 Sep 2026</span></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="โรงเรียนเต้าหมิง" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-02-21">21 February 2026 (B.E. 2569)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Old Town Storytelling Event at Tao Ming School, Takua Pa</h2><p>Press releases reported a full day of activities hosted at Tao Ming School.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/tao-ming/">Tao Ming School</a> · YOUPHUKET</div><a class="news-out" href="https://youphuket.club/author/admin/page/58/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง" data-year="2026"><time datetime="2026-01-30">30 January 2026 (B.E. 2569)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Inviting check-ins at Boon Soong iron bridge, mining heritage of Takua Pa town</h2><p>NBT presented the bridge as a mining heritage site and historical landmark, noting its temporary closure for a foreign film production.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/iron-bridge/">Boon Soong Iron Bridge</a> · NBT2HD</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QUZ54DTc0LQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ลอยกระทง" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-11-05">5 November 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Loy Krathong activities at Khlong Takua Pa and Khlong Bang Muang</h2><p>The Department of Marine and Coastal Resources reported the 2025 (2568) event and the large participation of the public.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">Loy Krathong</a> · กรมทรัพยากรทางทะเลและชายฝั่ง (Department of Marine and Coastal Resources)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://newweb.dmcr.go.th/detailAll/81026/nws/258" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-06-19">19 June 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Guideline to develop Lan Long Market into a modern food center</h2><p>News reported the market development plan and increased street food choices, while it is not verified if the construction is completed.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a> · Siam Rath</div><a class="news-out" href="https://siamrath.co.th/n/630235" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-04-13">13 April 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga continues Songkran traditions with alms offering in Takua Pa old town</h2><p>Phra Khru Nikorn Thammasophit and monks from Wat Nikornwararam participated in provincial activities.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a> · TOPNEWS</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.topnews.co.th/news/1546452" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-03-14">14 March 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phra Narai Worship and Takua Pa Good Products Fair 2025 (2568 BE)</h2><p>Announced the event schedule for 14 to 23 March 2025 at the park.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/phra-narai/">Phra Narai Park</a> · ThailandTravel</div><a class="news-out" href="https://thailandtravel.app/content/read/3344" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดบรมธาตุคีรีเขต (วัดลุ่ม)" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-02-12">Feb 12, 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga invited &#x27;Phra Si Borommathat&#x27; onto a royal chariot for a procession around Takua Pa old town</h2><p>The 2025 (2568 BE) Makha Bucha event was held at Wat Phrathat Khiri Khet, featuring a procession around the old town and circling the vihara.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a> · ไทยโพสต์ (Thai Post)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.thaipost.net/district-news/738702/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ขบวนแห่อัญเชิญพระบรมสารีริกธาตุขึ้นเขาพระบาท" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-02-11">11 Feb 2025 (2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga holds a grand Makha Bucha event to pay respect to the Buddha's relics</h2><p>Promoted the event on 11 to 12 February 2025 (2568) at Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet and the procession activity.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">Relic Procession to Khao Phra Bat</a> · MGR Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/travel/detail/9680000012560" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ขบวนแห่อัญเชิญพระบรมสารีริกธาตุขึ้นเขาพระบาท" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-02-11">11 Feb 2025 (2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Makha Bucha Day 2025 paying respect to the Buddha's relics in Takua Pa</h2><p>Reported the schedule for the royal chariot procession around the old town and the enshrining of the Buddha's relics into the stupa.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">Relic Procession to Khao Phra Bat</a> · Kapook Travel</div><a class="news-out" href="https://travel.kapook.com/view288836.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" data-year="2025"><time datetime="2025-01-01">Jan 1, 2025 (B.E. 2568)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Inspection of the Temple, Public, State, Creating Happiness project</h2><p>Wat Nikornwararam was mentioned as a temple ready for southern regional assessment.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a> · Ride Explorer</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.ride-explorer.com/?p=7378" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-11-01">Nov 1, 2024 (B.E. 2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Coconut costs affect Hor Mok prices in Lan Long Market</h2><p>News cited an example of a Ton Pho Hor Mok vendor in Lan Long Market adjusting prices due to higher coconut costs.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a> · MGR Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/daily/detail/9670000105538" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-10-10">Oct 10, 2024 (B.E. 2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Merit-making and 9-Baht vegetarian food event in Takua Pa old town</h2><p>Vegetarian food activities and community traditions are held on the cultural street, with a large number of participants according to news reports.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a> · Manager Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/south/detail/9670000097253" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศาลเจ้าพ่อกวนอู ซิ่นไช่ตึ๋ง" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-10-02">Oct 2, 2024 (B.E. 2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>An old shrine in Takua Pa district, Phang Nga province, has performed the Go Teng pole raising ceremony</h2><p>Reports on the Go Teng pole raising ceremony at Guan Yu (Sin Chai Tung) Shrine, Rong Phra Talat Tai, to begin the vegetarian festival.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/guan-yu/">Guan Yu / Sin Chai Tung Shrine</a> · Manager Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/south/detail/9670000093105" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-09-22">Sep 22, 2024 (B.E. 2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga monks unite to help flood victims in the north</h2><p>The temple set up a donation center for items together with the monastic community and the public.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a> · Siam Rath</div><a class="news-out" href="https://archive.siamrath.co.th/n/568331" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ประเพณีกินผัก (เจี๊ยะกิ๊วอ๋องฉ่าย)" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-09-01">1 Sep 2024 (2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Press conference ready for Takua Pa old town vegetarian festival activities</h2><p>Promoted the event for 3 to 11 October 2024 (2567), specifying 29 participating shrines and vegetarian halls.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">Vegetarian Festival (Jia Kiu Ong Chai)</a> · Thailand Plus News</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.thailandplus.tv/archives/864741" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-09-01">1 Sep 2024 (2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Municipality invites eating at Lan Long Market</h2><p>Takua Pa Town Municipality published a video recommending the market and various types of food.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a> · เทศบาลเมืองตะกั่วป่า (Takua Pa Town Municipality)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YBj0I_sMc-I" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2024"><time datetime="2024-08-28">Aug 28, 2024 (B.E. 2567)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Tracing the legend of Takola to the charm of Takua Pa old town</h2><p>Phang Nga province and the municipality promote old town tourism and stimulate the community economy. No specific mention of museum restoration.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/museum/">Takua Pa Community Museum</a> · กรมประชาสัมพันธ์ (Public Relations Department)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.prd.go.th/th/content/category/detail/id/2040/iid/319567" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ประเพณีชักพระ" data-year="2023"><time datetime="2023-10-31">Oct 31, 2023 (B.E. 2566)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Preserving the Chak Phra Tradition 2023 (2566)</h2><p>News reported the event in Khura Buri District, Phang Nga, featuring the pulling of the Buddha boat from communities and a celebration. This is used as comparative data, not Takua Pa news.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/traditions/">Chak Phra Festival</a> · Thailand Plus Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.thailandplus.tv/archives/755868" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง" data-year="2023"><time datetime="2023-10-23">Oct 23, 2023 (B.E. 2566)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Fierce finale! Phang Nga Vegetarian Festival procession around Takua Pa city</h2><p>Reported on the Ew Keng ceremony where Kue Chai Tung Shrine joined Sin Chai Tung Shrine.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a> · Innews</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.innews.news/news.php?n=48726" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดเสนานุชรังสรรค์ (วัดใหม่)" data-year="2023"><time datetime="2023-07-20">Jul 20, 2023 (B.E. 2566)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Takua Pa Town Municipality tours Wat Senanucharangsan and invites participation in the ubosot restoration permission ceremony</h2><p>A municipality promotional video mentions the old town temple and specifies the blessing ceremony to request permission to restore the ubosot on July 26, 2023, alongside the candle procession activity around town.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-sena/">Wat Sena Nuch Rangsan</a> · เทศบาลเมืองตะกั่วป่า (Takua Pa Town Municipality)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=76z9YMImUUk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="สวนสาธารณะพระนารายณ์" data-year="2023"><time datetime="2023-03-31">Mar 31, 2023 (B.E. 2566)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phra Narai worship ceremony, an identity of Takua Pa people</h2><p>Reported on the annual event in 2023 (2566 BE), which was held at the park between 27 March and 5 April.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/phra-narai/">Phra Narai Park</a> · ThaiPR.NET</div><a class="news-out" href="https://www.thaipr.net/travel/3321904" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="วัดนิกรวราราม (วัดย่านยาว)" data-year="2022"><time datetime="2022-10-30">Oct 30, 2022 (B.E. 2565)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga Provincial Office of Buddhism joins in handing over the land title deed documents of Wat Nikornwararam</h2><p>Handing over the land title deed documents to Phra Khru Nikorn Thammasophit, the abbot of Wat Nikornwararam.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/wat-nikorn/">Wat Nikornwararam</a> · สำนักงานพระพุทธศาสนาจังหวัดพังงา (Phang Nga Provincial Office of Buddhism)</div><a class="news-out" href="https://pna.onab.go.th/th/content/page/index/id/34431" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2022"><time datetime="2022-06-26">Jun 26, 2022 (B.E. 2565)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Phang Nga opens Takua Pa walking street in the rainy season with free Pho Thong buses</h2><p>Green season activities were held every Sunday from 26 June to 28 August 2022 to distribute income to the community.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a> · Manager Online</div><a class="news-out" href="https://mgronline.com/travel/detail/9650000061422" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original news ↗</a></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" data-year="2022"><time datetime="2022-04-17">Apr 17, 2022 (B.E. 2565)</time><div class="news-content"><h2>Takua Pa old town cultural street in the Must-See Market activity</h2><p>The Department of Internal Trade reported on activities promoting community market channels at the Takua Pa old town cultural street.</p><div class="news-meta"><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a> · กรมการค้าภายใน (Department of Internal Trade)</div><span class="news-out news-out-offline">Original article has been taken down · checked 8 Sep 2026</span></div></article><article class="news-item" data-place="ศาลเจ้าปุนเถ่ากงอ๊า" data-year="2021"><time datetime="2021-10-28">Oct 28, 2021 (B.E. 2564)<